			"notes": "## 🛠️ SteveParty Mod Pre-Release Announcement\n\n🎉 **Get ready to transform your Minecraft world with the SteveParty Mod!** 🎉\n\nThis pre-release version introduces a host of exciting features and custom mechanics designed to take your creative and survival gameplay to the next level. Here's a sneak peek at what's included:\n\n### 🌟 Highlights\n- **Party Mechanics:** Dive into innovative party game creation usings the `PartyController` and `StepController` and multiple other blocks reacting and causing different mechanics.\n- **Custom Entities:** Meet the new `HidingTrader` for yout custom shops and the magical floating `Dice`. Don't forget that any entities in your world can be tokenized and/or silenced and become a playable Token for any of your game.\n- **Enhanced Gameplay:** Add `Tiles` and `TriggerPoint` to your board with up to 15 custom behaviors per BoardSpace using cartridges.\n- **Visual Flair:** Enjoy custom particle effects, sounds, and animations that bring your world to life.\n\n### 🔧 Installation\n1. Download the pre-release mod file from the GitHub releases page.\n2. Place it in your `mods` folder.\n3. Launch Minecraft with Fabric, and let the party begin!\n(Client-Server environment not yet tested)\n\n### ⚠️ Note\nThis pre-release is intended for testing and feedback. Please report bugs or suggestions via GitHub issues.\n\n---\n\nBe among the first to experience SteveParty's innovative features. Your feedback will help shape the future of this mod! 🥳"
		}
